@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Comment Moderation
|User|
start
:Write comment;
:Publish comment;
|System|
:Save comment;
:Show comment at the top\nof the model feed;
|Administrator|
:Review recent comments;
if () then ([comment is OK])
  :Keep comment;
  stop
else ([inappropriate])
  if () then ([first time])
  else ([repeated abuse])
    :Block author;
    |System|
    :Set author status\nto BLOCKED;
    |Administrator|
  endif
  :Delete comment;
endif
|System|
:Remove comment from the feed;
stop
@enduml
